<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4284] Failed second client node join with continuous query and peer class loading enabled</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4284</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Start server with cache and peer class loading enabled.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Start client with peer class loading enabled.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Start continuous query with custom event filter factory.&lt;br/&gt;
4) Start second client &amp;#8211; Fail with NPE or AsserionError.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test that reproduces error: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1681&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR#1681&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
